BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_314901182@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260522T042105Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260523T200000
SUMMARY:Social Game Night @ Archetype West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nBring your favorite game(s) or
  learn a new one – members are always happy to teach! See you there and 
 have a blast!\n**Welcome to the Game Night Extravaganza!**\n\nCalling all 
 dice-rollers\, card-shufflers\, and strategy-curious adventurers!\nAre wee
 knights feeling a tad mundane? Fear not! We’ve got the antidote: **Board
  Games\, Brews\, and Bliss**.\n\n**Our Mission:** To ignite laughter\, for
 ge alliances\, and maybe—just maybe—unleash a few friendly rivalries &
  battle to the death!\nNo PhD in rulebooks required! Whether you’re a Se
 ttlers of Catan enthusiast or a Code Names solving ninja\, or your first t
 ime touching a board game ***we will explain all the rules needed.***\n\nE
 xpect:\n\n* **Beer on Tap**: Because rolling dice is better with a pint in
  hand.\n* **Low Brainpower Required**: We’re all about fun\, not Fermat
 ’s Last Theorem.\n* **Epic Showdowns**: Ticket to Ride routes\, Splendor
  gem heists\, and High stakes Camel Up.\n\nFeel free to request any game y
 ou’d like to play or bring your own. So gather your guild\, stack your r
 esource cards\, and let the games begin! May your laughter be loud\, your 
 moves be bold\, and your victory dances be legendary.\n\nSee you at the ta
 ble!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /314901182/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260522T002206Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260522T002206Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
